+// ── P15C Wave 2 — the Campaign Legacy root and the one P15 allocator, Save44 ──
+// REFERENCE ONLY (record 1359-C): the step number is allocated at execution (1355-F
+// Amendment 4); the parent merges the P15 roots that share it. Two top-level roots, the V40
